Well, in my case, I was playing with two relative newbs, and all three of Gloomweaver&#39;s relics were near the top of his deck, as well as all three of his Vast Followings (though one of them was wasted on turn 1), which brought back two of his relics after we went through the trouble of destroying them. I think most of the damage we took actually came from Primordial Plant Life and Rivers of Lava, because we mostly managed to keep Gloomweaver&#39;s damage under control.
